domain MIGRATION_ACTION_AVAILABILITY:
  description "Align the retained explicit migration control with its existing runtime availability gates."
evidence OWNER:
  "Owner requires V2 character ordinary writes retired, historical/current display retained, and permits explicit V3 migration exceptions. Owner reports current V2 Miki read-only UI OK, historical navigation now opens, and asks whether visible V3 migration button is usable. Necessary deployment, image creation, normal origin push/CI are permitted in this session."
evidence OBSERVED:
  "CharacterDetailPage renders upgradeAction for old owned current profiles. Repository provides upgradeAction based on old generation, without runtime capability. Runtime index calls buildRoutes with only llm; enableCharacterMigrationAcceptanceTrial defaults false. Live fixed revision has no SEMANTIC_AUTHORING configuration and policy is off. POST upgrade rejects absent provider; focused acceptance independently rejects the disabled activation gate. Thus current button cannot complete migration."
decision CAUSE based_on OBSERVED:
  "Version eligibility alone advertises an action whose execution and acceptance capability are unavailable. Existing runtime gates are not reflected in the profile DTO. This is a display/admission mismatch, not evidence that enabling migration would work."
premise LIMIT:
  "Keep existing provider/activation configuration disabled and preserve permitted explicit migration code and manual V3 conversion path. Do not broaden into enabling providers or migration. Current product correction follows existing capability gates; no new external version promise."
decision FIX based_on OWNER, OBSERVED, CAUSE, LIMIT:
  "Current character GET exposes upgradeAction only when semantic provider and existing migration activation trial gate are both enabled; otherwise returns null. UI explains current automatic migration unavailability for owner of V2. Preserve existing explicit candidate preparation and acceptance gates. Existing no-provider rejection still occurs before attempt/provider work; do not alter the controlled headless candidate preparation contract. Historical profiles retain null action. Add behavioral regressions for unavailable control and no authoring attempt, retain existing allowed trial tests. Run selected tests/typecheck/static/GUI as applicable, freeze source and CI, then one necessary build/no-traffic preview backend and one matching frontend upload plus oldtag retarget, preserving existing alias, env, auth and public deployment. No character/data/migration/provider write. Remaining20-40agent min low-confidence estimate; waits separate."
